ilaṅ","trans":"todos ellos","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"ei mahāmantra","trans":"en todo momento","sep":"","error":"mismatch"}],[{"text":"ihā","trans":"canta","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"japa","trans":"por lo tanto","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"giyā","trans":"regulación","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"sabe kariyā","trans":"nada más","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"nirbandha","trans":"-","sep":"","error":"mismatch"}],[{"text":"ihā","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"haite","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"sarvva","trans":"-","sep":"-","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"siddhi","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"haibe","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"sabāra","trans":"-","sep":"","error":"mismatch"}],[{"text":"sarvva","trans":"-","sep":"-","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"kṣaṇa","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"bolo","trans":"-","sep":", ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"ithe","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"vidhi","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"nāhi","trans":"-","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"āra”","trans":"-","sep":"","error":"mismatch"}]]},{"text":["“ki śayane ki bhojane, ki vā jāgaraṇe","aharniśa chinta kṛṣṇa, boloho vadane”","“yadi āma-prati sneha thāke sabākāra","tabe kṛṣṇa-vyatirikta nā gāibe āra”"],"word_by_word":["**ki śayane** — ya sea que duermas; **ki bhojane** — ya sea que comas; **ki vā jāgaraṇe** — incluso despierto; **aharniśa** — de día o de noche; **chinta** — pensar; **kṛṣṇa** — en Kṛṣṇa; **boloho** — ¡oh canta!; **vadane** — con la boca; **jadi** — si; **āma** — a mí; **prati** — de acuerdo; **sneha** — afecto; **thāke** — existe; **sabākāra** — todos ellos; **tabe** — entonces; **kṛṣṇa** — Kṛṣṇa; **vyatirikta** — excepto; **nā** — no; **gāibe** — hablarás; **āra** — más."],"translation":["“Ya sea que duerman, coman o caminen, de día y de noche piensen en Kṛṣṇa e invoquen Su Nombre en 